{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 43, "model_name": "mistralai/mixtral-8x7b-instruct-v0.1", "content": " Upon the distant shore of Japan thou shalt arrive\nIn the land of the rising sun, where ancient and modern realms entwine\n\nFirst, in Tokyo's heart, the metropolis splendid, do alight\nThe Imperial Palace, Meiji Shrine, and Senso-ji Temple, behold with eyes aglow\n\nStroll through the bustling streets of Shibuya and Ginza, admire the wondrous sights\nPartake in the delicate art of tea ceremony, let the tranquility enfold thee\n\nThence, to Kamakura, home of the Great Buddha, majestic in its serene repose\nPonder the fleeting nature of existence, as Zen teachings bid thee\n\nIn Hakone, bathe in the soothing onsen, and gaze upon the lovely Mount Fuji\nLet the mineral-rich waters soothe thy weary limbs, and find peace in nature's arms\n\nNext, in Kyoto, the city of a thousand temples, where time seems to stand still\nYonder, Kinkaku-ji, Ginkaku-ji, and Fushimi Inari, pay homage to their sacred beauty\n\nWander through Arashiyama's bamboo grove, and marvel at the kaleidoscope of colors\nIn the Geisha district of Gion, catch a glimpse of the elusive maiko, a vision of grace\n\nLastly, in Hiroshima, reflect upon the past, and honor the memory of the fallen\nMourn the loss, and celebrate the resilience, for from ashes, hope arises anew\n\nNow, set forth on this wondrous journey, and let Japan's beauty captivate thy soul\nIn this far-off land, discover thyself, and forge memories to last an eternity", "logprobs": [{"token": "Upon", "logprob": -0.16018113493919373}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -0.012731345370411873}, {"token": "distant", "logprob": -1.8058785200119019}, {"token": "shore", "logprob": -1.0330499410629272}, {"token": "of", "logprob": -9.179073458653875e-06}, {"token": "Japan", "logprob": -0.004595077130943537}, {"token": "thou", "logprob": -0.9959705471992493}, {"token": "sh", "logprob": -0.045661378651857376}, {"token": "alt", "logpr